  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere, Life sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use the Alteration sphere shapeshift sphere ability, you may spend 1 additional spell point to affect each target of that shapeshift with a Life sphere ability (such as a cure, invigorate, or restore effect), spending any additional spell points as required. You may not use this feat to harm the shapeshifted target (such as using the Life sphere Affliction talent to inflict damage or a negative condition).</p>\n<p>In addition, you may treat your Alteration sphere shapeshift sphere ability as though it were a Life sphere ability for the purposes of granting the benefits of a Life sphere (vitality) talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc91\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
